//! The TrueType Instructor tool (shortcut I): plain keys add instructions, the selection follows the Select tool. Hidden from the toolbar until M10.25 adds its row to `tool::TOOLS` and its arm to `tool::make_tool`.
//!
//! Rows: `trueTypeInstructor`, `hinting.tt.tool.plainKeysAreInstructions`, `hint.tt.toggleDirection`, `hint.tt.increasePixelSize`, `hint.tt.decreasePixelSize`, `hint.tt.showPointIndexes`. Package M10.25 fills this module.
